  Konyklabs.Dotgithub.RoleJob.ApplyJob -. "`comments, labels, fields — nothing else`" .-> Konyklabs.Roadmap.Issues
  Konyklabs.Dotgithub.Heartbeat -. "`opens an issue when a job stops firing, 
